WEBVTT

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:32.173
Wakati wengine, wangezigawana nguo,

00:02:32.173 --> 00:02:34.982
na hata viatu.

00:02:34.982 --> 00:02:39.649
Lakini maisha zao ziliishia tofauti,

00:02:39.649 --> 00:02:41.646
kwa njia mbili tofauti.

00:02:43.039 --> 00:02:46.754
Yule msichana mwengine ni dada yangu mdogo.

00:02:46.754 --> 00:02:51.677
Dada yangu alikuwa na miaka 11

00:02:51.677 --> 00:02:54.329
alipopata mimba.

00:02:56.029 --> 00:02:59.742
Ni jambo la kuumiza.